{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、４月１日はエイプリルフールでしたね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウソが\nうそが\n嘘が\nウソガ\nウソガ\nウソが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"唯一許される日でしたね。\n私は...\nウソを信じてしまいます！そう\nよく騙されます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウソをつかないで下さいね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マジで！\nホントにお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/02/6720190/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと今日ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nミュージックジャパンの収録がありました〜(´∀｀)\n新曲\nおいでシャンプーを初めてみなさんの前で歌いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから沢山の声援をもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/02/6720190/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日見れなかったみなさんも、次のライブで一緒に盛り上がりましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/02/6720190/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では...\nへばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}